{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-letter-to-council-leaders-on-the-postponement-of-may-2026-local-elections","content_id":"31711080-7510-4e1f-87a2-f39db67b6007","description":"Letter from the Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government to council leaders to summarise decisions made on the postponement of 2026 local elections.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69720b4ca1311bdcfa0ed8ab","filename":"Letter_to_Council_Leaders_on_postponement_of_local_elections_in_May_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":209386,"filename":"Letter_to_Council_Leaders_on_postponement_of_local_elections_in_May_2026.pdf","id":"9087229","isbn":"","number_of_pages":5,"title":"Letter to council leaders on the postponement of May 2026 local elections","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69720b4ca1311bdcfa0ed8ab/Letter_to_Council_Leaders_on_postponement_of_local_elections_in_May_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>​​​On 22 January 2026, the Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government wrote to council leaders to set out the decisions made in respect of the postponement of local elections in May 2026, after assessing representations received on the issue.​​</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-22T13:58:47Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&q